<title>USA: U.S. tallow data - Census.</title>
<headline>U.S. tallow data - Census.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Census Bureau reported tallow data as follows (Mln Lbs):</p>
<p>END-MO. STOCKS April 97  March 97  April 96</p>
<p>     Inedible	298.9    346.2-R   335.9</p>
<p>	 Edible	 44.5     41.5-R    51.0</p>
<p>OUTPUT--</p>
<p>     Inedible	501.8    497.0-R   539.0</p>
<p>	 Edible	117.0    113.0-R   124.5</p>
<p>CONSUMPTION--</p>
<p>     Inedible	289.3    260.0     299.0</p>
<p>	 Edible	 43.7     38.1-R    46.0</p>
